  "qid": "323",
  "tip": "<p>When diagnosing hotspotting in Spanner, focus on the <i>leading key</i>. Prefer <i>high-cardinality</i> prefixes or <i>bit-reversed</i> sequences and avoid <i>monotonic</i> or <i>low-cardinality</i> leading values.</p>",
